(cherry picked from commit e6c8ea9d486110a6ad37b0d8f130c7e7b7e7e411 26.04_linux-nvidia-bos)
Signed-off-by: Jiandi An <jan@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Seth Forshee <sforshee@nvidia.com>
